WEBVTT

00:13.054 --> 00:13.930
"Tang."

00:15.515 --> 00:17.267
"I don't think I can go with you."

00:20.061 --> 00:23.023
I'm sorry I couldn't
tell you the truth in the end.

00:24.024 --> 00:25.483
You'll be fine without me.

00:26.985 --> 00:28.611
You're the one with the skill.

00:30.780 --> 00:32.907
Just do whatever your gut tells you to.

00:33.825 --> 00:36.202
If you do that,
everything will work out just fine.

00:38.496 --> 00:40.498
I had no choice to begin with.

00:40.999 --> 00:42.792
Life isn't an essay question.

00:43.376 --> 00:44.753
It's multiple-choice.

01:11.154 --> 01:12.072
But then again…

01:15.784 --> 01:18.244
maybe everything so far was my choice.

01:21.081 --> 01:22.916
Maybe there is no right answer.

01:27.962 --> 01:28.880
And now

01:30.340 --> 01:32.050
I'm about to make another choice.

01:35.011 --> 01:37.347
A KILLER PARADOX

02:02.205 --> 02:03.957
-Your mother…
-Hmm?

02:04.040 --> 02:05.208
She's okay.

02:06.626 --> 02:07.627
Thankfully.

02:09.003 --> 02:10.713
She'll regain consciousness soon.

02:11.840 --> 02:12.799
Hmm.

02:19.889 --> 02:20.807
Hey…

02:21.432 --> 02:23.309
We will make sure to

02:24.352 --> 02:27.230
take care of, uh… your father's funeral.

02:31.192 --> 02:35.113
-Okay.
-So you should go home… and rest.

02:43.621 --> 02:44.497
Okay.

02:47.000 --> 02:47.917
See you.

03:08.730 --> 03:10.940
Yes, sir. Detective Kim!

03:11.482 --> 03:13.026
Did you see Detective Jang?

03:13.109 --> 03:14.652
Why? He just left here.

03:14.736 --> 03:16.779
The boss has been on my ass to find him.

03:18.448 --> 03:20.116
This really isn't the right time.

03:20.200 --> 03:23.703
It's just… he hasn't gone back
to return his firearm yet.

03:23.786 --> 03:26.915
So I think…
something could get out of hand.

03:41.304 --> 03:43.139
Where's Song Chon?

03:53.483 --> 03:54.359
Stay low.

03:57.820 --> 03:59.656
Detective Jang.

04:01.032 --> 04:03.034
I don't know what I could possibly say.

04:04.035 --> 04:06.454
I'd be lying if I said
I knew how you feel.

04:09.624 --> 04:11.626
Hey, take it easy.

04:12.877 --> 04:15.129
I promise,
I'm going to get this Song Chon.

04:15.630 --> 04:16.756
So don't worry.

04:17.257 --> 04:18.883
Go home and get some rest, okay?

04:18.967 --> 04:21.010
I'll finish up here
and go to the funeral home.

04:21.094 --> 04:22.178
Yes, sir. Thanks.

04:22.262 --> 04:24.973
-Are you okay?
-Yes, I'll be fine.

04:25.056 --> 04:27.934
-You want water? I have some in the car.
-No thanks, sir.

04:35.441 --> 04:38.611
Hey! Detective Jang!
Detective Jang! Detective…

04:53.334 --> 04:55.962
What are you gonna do with Song Chon?

04:58.881 --> 05:00.133
DETECTIVE KIM

05:01.884 --> 05:04.012
And what are you gonna do
about Tang?

05:04.095 --> 05:07.098
Hey, you keep your mouth closed,
or I'll have to kill you first, okay?

05:09.892 --> 05:11.144
HEROES

05:16.566 --> 05:18.693
You know how I told you
that Tang is different?

05:20.028 --> 05:21.070
DETECTIVE KIM

05:21.154 --> 05:22.196
I told you to shut up.

05:23.531 --> 05:26.034
Tang is special.
You know it, too, Detective.

05:26.117 --> 05:27.618
Tang leaves no evidence behind.

05:27.702 --> 05:29.537
After I kill Song Chon,
you and Tang are next.

05:29.620 --> 05:31.664
So that's not gonna change anything.

05:33.541 --> 05:35.585
I'll help you catch Song Chon.

05:36.294 --> 05:39.589
I don't care what happens to me, but Tang…

05:40.631 --> 05:42.258
Could you just leave Tang alone?

05:48.389 --> 05:49.390
Hey.

05:49.474 --> 05:51.768
-What's he doing?
-Hey, that's mine!

05:52.560 --> 05:54.062
Stop! Stop!

06:05.865 --> 06:07.033
Ah shit.

06:10.953 --> 06:11.871
Oh shit.

06:23.800 --> 06:26.511
All of this happened because of me.

06:29.097 --> 06:31.391
So I have to take responsibility.

06:49.742 --> 06:51.953
EUNSUNG CHICKEN

07:04.257 --> 07:07.135
You know that the people Tang killed
all deserved to die.

07:13.599 --> 07:14.934
Hey.

07:15.017 --> 07:17.395
I was there when he killed Prosecutor Ji.

07:17.478 --> 07:19.647
This video was found
on the prosecutor's phone.

07:20.815 --> 07:23.609
And you know
the high school girl from Daejeon?

07:24.110 --> 07:25.653
It was Prosecutor Ji's doing.

07:25.736 --> 07:27.989
Please let me go.

07:41.085 --> 07:43.212
Are you saying
you two abducted and killed him?

07:43.296 --> 07:44.505
Huh?

07:44.589 --> 07:47.300
-Because you weren't catching him--
-Fucking crazy motherfucker!

07:47.383 --> 07:49.427
You think you're God?

07:50.052 --> 07:51.387
Who are you to choose?

07:51.888 --> 07:54.724
Do you have the right to decide
who deserves to die? Hmm?

07:56.726 --> 07:57.685
And what about you?

07:58.436 --> 08:02.482
You're not going after Song Chon as an
officer of the law. You've got a vendetta.

08:03.858 --> 08:04.817
Am I wrong?

08:08.488 --> 08:09.780
My father was…

08:14.869 --> 08:16.913
I have a good enough reason for it, huh?

08:29.467 --> 08:30.843
Just listen to me.

08:33.471 --> 08:35.765
Song Chon has nothing left to lose.

08:36.390 --> 08:40.811
And after this whole case is over with,
I'll take my punishment.

08:42.939 --> 08:45.650
I have everything
planned out, from A to Z.

08:46.317 --> 08:47.610
So just…

08:49.320 --> 08:51.948
Just, please,
won't you hear me out for once?

09:01.874 --> 09:02.833
ROH BIN - ME
OSAN

09:51.382 --> 09:52.925
Don't tell me.

09:54.510 --> 09:55.803
You came alone.

09:57.221 --> 09:58.389
That's no fun.

09:59.890 --> 10:01.475
You should stop now.

10:02.518 --> 10:04.395
I'll do anything you want me to do.

10:05.605 --> 10:08.399
I don't want
anything from you.

10:10.192 --> 10:13.529
I know that I'm the only one
who can help you right now.

10:14.363 --> 10:15.489
You know that too.

10:16.490 --> 10:18.200
If I kill you right here,

10:18.826 --> 10:21.621
I'll have just enough time
to go and kill Lee Tang too.

10:23.789 --> 10:24.874
Hmm?

10:26.584 --> 10:28.544
What's that noise?

10:32.882 --> 10:35.384
I can hear the gears turning in your head.

10:36.010 --> 10:38.804
It's a lot of fun.

10:40.556 --> 10:45.227
Trying to guess what you've got cooking
up there in that, uh… in that noggin.

10:46.729 --> 10:48.981
You're just too predictable.
You know that?

11:00.951 --> 11:02.411
Aah.

11:06.874 --> 11:10.002
I was planning to kill Lee Tang
to start with.

11:10.086 --> 11:12.004
Screwed up my order. Hmm.

11:13.464 --> 11:14.423
By the way,

11:15.883 --> 11:17.843
are you two working together?

11:23.808 --> 11:25.685
I knew you would come.

11:26.394 --> 11:27.978
This is earlier than I thought.

11:29.855 --> 11:31.899
Goodness.

11:31.982 --> 11:32.858
Right, okay.

11:33.943 --> 11:37.363
When you ratted me out last time,
he's the one you told. Am I right?

11:38.906 --> 11:40.408
Yeesh, you little…

11:40.908 --> 11:42.451
Dirty little rat.

11:42.535 --> 11:44.578
He's using you, you know? Huh?

11:45.121 --> 11:47.164
All his life, he's been out to catch me.

11:47.248 --> 11:50.084
-For cracking his dad's skull--
-You mean to kill, not to catch.

11:50.584 --> 11:51.502
Hah.

12:27.747 --> 12:29.039
Nan-gam.

12:29.123 --> 12:32.460
Are you really here for revenge
against your ol' ajeossi?

12:34.503 --> 12:35.963
You should be thanking me!

12:36.922 --> 12:39.216
He wasn't exactly living the life.

12:39.300 --> 12:42.219
Besides, I put him out of his misery.

12:43.888 --> 12:46.140
You were thinking about
when to put him down, anyway.

12:50.144 --> 12:51.103
You're right.

12:53.689 --> 12:54.607
Thank you.

12:57.693 --> 12:58.527
So what?

12:59.528 --> 13:01.322
You gonna pull the trigger this time?

13:06.160 --> 13:09.163
You just don't have
the eyes of a killer, kiddo. Huh?

13:21.008 --> 13:23.969
Lee! Lee Tang! Now this is exciting!

13:29.058 --> 13:31.143
Hey, this time, you didn't run away!

13:31.685 --> 13:33.020
The balls on you!

13:33.103 --> 13:34.563
Points for you, champ!

13:35.940 --> 13:38.150
Tang, why are you here?

13:38.692 --> 13:40.653
To end it all.

13:44.824 --> 13:47.034
So let's have
a real grand finale, shall we?

13:51.789 --> 13:53.457
Hey, hey, hey, wait.

13:53.541 --> 13:55.125
Hey! Hey, hey, hey!

13:55.209 --> 13:56.752
Hey, punk…

14:02.132 --> 14:04.343
Hey, don't shoot! Don't shoot!

14:04.426 --> 14:06.971
Nan-gam, just wait. Hey!

14:08.347 --> 14:10.766
Hey, shouldn't you be
shooting at him, not me?

14:10.850 --> 14:12.560
You're supposed to be a cop!

14:12.643 --> 14:14.103
Cut it out!

14:14.979 --> 14:16.647
You little… Gah!

14:17.481 --> 14:19.525
Oh, jeez, I can't believe he shot at me.

15:25.925 --> 15:28.135
Farewell… kid.

15:29.053 --> 15:30.930
Oh… oh no…

15:36.644 --> 15:39.980
Didn't you know… it ends like this?

15:42.608 --> 15:43.609
Hyung.

15:46.278 --> 15:48.113
Ah.

15:48.697 --> 15:50.449
Why?

15:50.532 --> 15:52.910
Why? Why did you have to come here?

15:55.621 --> 15:57.081
We could've just…

15:59.249 --> 16:01.126
lived our separate lives.

16:06.131 --> 16:07.675
Because I was needed.

16:12.638 --> 16:13.847
This world,

16:14.765 --> 16:16.308
well, it could really use

16:17.226 --> 16:18.435
people like us.

16:25.192 --> 16:26.110
You see…

16:26.193 --> 16:28.195
BLIND VICTIM TURNS OUT
TO BE MURDERER OF HER PARENTS

16:28.278 --> 16:29.947
…I had to know…

16:31.573 --> 16:33.033
…if you were like me.

16:34.284 --> 16:35.244
I INSULTED MY ELDERS

16:35.327 --> 16:36.203
How…

16:36.328 --> 16:37.246
I MURDERED CHOI IN-SEON

16:37.329 --> 16:38.914
How could you distinguish them?

16:42.501 --> 16:44.003
And were you ever certain…

16:50.884 --> 16:51.969
And could such power…

16:52.052 --> 16:53.387
IDENTIFICATION CERTIFICATE
LEE TANG

16:53.470 --> 16:56.306
…really exist?

17:03.981 --> 17:05.274
Are you different?

17:07.151 --> 17:08.235
Are you different

17:09.236 --> 17:10.154
from me?

17:12.573 --> 17:14.658
Do you think that you are? Huh?

17:17.453 --> 17:18.412
Are you certain?

17:21.540 --> 17:22.666
Just shut the hell up.

17:27.212 --> 17:28.881
Nan-gam.

17:30.632 --> 17:32.134
What do you…

17:32.760 --> 17:36.138
…think you know that justifies
doing this to me?

17:37.389 --> 17:38.849
What does your mom say?

17:39.725 --> 17:40.642
Your mom…

17:44.104 --> 17:47.024
Your mom… wasn't any better.

17:47.107 --> 17:49.234
You wanna tell that disgusting story now?

17:49.818 --> 17:52.821
Right. The station food
can't be good.

17:53.781 --> 17:54.656
Oh!

17:56.033 --> 17:58.202
Oh, um, I'll call you back later.

18:01.955 --> 18:03.332
OFFICER ATTACKED AND PARALYZED

18:03.415 --> 18:05.334
BY SUBORDINATE
INVOLVED IN DRUG CORRUPTION?

18:05.417 --> 18:07.711
You have no idea how little I care
about who you slept with.

18:07.795 --> 18:09.588
So just cut the bullshit.

18:11.173 --> 18:12.466
It's pathetic.

18:19.264 --> 18:21.225
Park Gwang-su, it was him!

18:22.434 --> 18:24.019
Your dad's friend!

18:25.854 --> 18:27.940
He's the one she cheated with.

18:28.023 --> 18:30.275
-No.
-You bastard.

18:30.359 --> 18:34.279
Do you… think I'm just
some filthy homewrecker?

18:35.697 --> 18:38.534
You're clueless, aren't you?
You little punk.

18:41.328 --> 18:42.329
So go ahead.

18:43.038 --> 18:43.997
Shoot.

18:44.873 --> 18:45.749
Only,

18:46.750 --> 18:47.751
if I die,

18:49.461 --> 18:50.796
you'll wonder

18:51.505 --> 18:53.590
why your dad was in there.

18:54.758 --> 18:57.010
You'll wonder for the rest of your life.

18:57.970 --> 18:59.304
Are you okay with that?

19:03.642 --> 19:05.102
So what do you say?

19:06.520 --> 19:07.688
Should I tell you?

19:19.158 --> 19:20.826
Oh, good evening, sir.

19:21.368 --> 19:23.287
Have some of this.

19:23.370 --> 19:24.204
Thanks.

19:25.789 --> 19:27.457
-Captain.
-Hey.

19:27.541 --> 19:29.376
-How are you?
-Good.

19:30.294 --> 19:31.545
You must be tired.

19:32.838 --> 19:34.882
Detective Jang. Detective Jang.

19:35.591 --> 19:36.675
You must be tired.

19:37.634 --> 19:38.510
You.

19:39.219 --> 19:41.471
Why are you here?
Shouldn't you be working?

19:42.055 --> 19:45.851
Uh, the shift starts in two hours.
And the captain said I could join.

19:47.102 --> 19:50.564
Stop being a nuisance
and go to work. This isn't a game.

19:51.648 --> 19:53.358
What, you got nothin' else to do?

19:54.610 --> 19:56.945
Well, I… just wanted to help out.

19:57.029 --> 19:58.197
Well, you aren't.

19:59.406 --> 20:01.450
Cut it out. Get lost. Go.

20:05.495 --> 20:06.580
Jeez.

20:07.414 --> 20:09.791
Come on, man.
Can't you be nicer to him?

20:09.875 --> 20:13.378
This stays between us,
but he didn't make it again.

20:13.462 --> 20:14.963
It's like…

20:15.047 --> 20:17.299
it's like
his dead father is holding him back.

20:17.382 --> 20:20.427
Still, you can't call him here.
He's not Violent Crimes.

20:21.136 --> 20:23.513
I mean,
the more the merrier, right?

20:38.528 --> 20:39.988
Put your hips in it!

20:45.244 --> 20:47.037
Take it easy. You're not a pro.

20:52.751 --> 20:53.877
I did boxing, judo.

20:53.961 --> 20:56.213
DO WHAT YOU HAVE TO TODAY
OR FAIL TO DO IT WHEN YOU NEED

20:56.296 --> 20:57.798
I tried everything I could.

20:57.881 --> 20:59.216
What's the address?

20:59.299 --> 21:02.052
And learned everything I could.

21:06.056 --> 21:07.182
Thanks for the meal.

21:07.266 --> 21:09.059
-Thanks.
-You're welcome.

21:11.353 --> 21:14.064
Ah, Jesus. What's with that idiot?

21:19.361 --> 21:20.862
-Ma'am.
-Yes?

21:20.946 --> 21:23.573
-I heard you're going back to Yanbian.
-That's right, next week.

21:24.241 --> 21:26.159
That's great.
You'll finally see your kids.

21:26.243 --> 21:29.121
It's all thanks to Detective Jang.

21:29.830 --> 21:31.081
Ah.

21:31.915 --> 21:34.167
Yeah, and they kept talking
about that stuff.

21:35.335 --> 21:36.670
Uh, Detective Jang?

21:38.255 --> 21:39.089
Hold on.

21:39.965 --> 21:41.049
What is it now?

21:41.133 --> 21:42.968
Uh… I'm sorry. Go ahead, sir.

21:43.719 --> 21:46.221
What? What is it? Just tell me.

21:48.307 --> 21:49.433
Uh, you heard, right?

21:49.516 --> 21:52.311
Ms. Hwang from the cafeteria
is going back to Yanbian.

21:52.394 --> 21:53.270
Huh? So?

21:54.146 --> 21:55.939
I thought we'd pool a little cash.

21:56.023 --> 21:58.108
I don't have time for this. Get lost.

21:58.692 --> 21:59.651
Ah. Sir.

22:03.155 --> 22:04.114
Hey!

22:06.616 --> 22:07.492
Come here.

22:09.995 --> 22:10.871
Yes, sir?

22:19.338 --> 22:23.175
Here, give her this. Tell her I'm sorry
I can't give it to her in person.

22:24.176 --> 22:25.886
Wow. Yes, sir!

22:30.057 --> 22:32.059
Everyone at the station pitched in.

22:32.142 --> 22:34.978
Aww! You really didn't have to.

22:35.812 --> 22:39.149
Oh, and this. Detective Jang told me
to give this to you.

22:39.775 --> 22:42.694
Aah. This must be
what he was talking about.

22:43.904 --> 22:45.864
What is it? Is it not for you?

22:45.947 --> 22:47.991
Ah, no, it's not mine.

22:48.075 --> 22:51.536
He… he asked me to… to go to
China and deliver it to someone.

22:51.620 --> 22:53.497
Ah, I see.

22:53.580 --> 22:57.084
…number of victims
is expected to increase exponentially

22:57.167 --> 23:00.796
as these gift card frauds are run
as part of a pyramid scheme.

23:02.047 --> 23:05.092
Our next story.
Hwang, a Korean-Chinese woman

23:05.175 --> 23:08.345
who attempted
to smuggle methamphetamine into China,

23:08.428 --> 23:12.474
has been apprehended by the local police
and is currently under investigation.

23:12.557 --> 23:14.559
It is said she has been smuggling
methamphetamine

23:14.643 --> 23:16.853
by diluting it in herbal medicine.

23:16.937 --> 23:18.480
APPREHENDED SMUGGLING METHAMPHETAMINE

23:18.563 --> 23:21.316
The Chinese police found
30 grams of the drug after security…

23:21.400 --> 23:23.276
Your father, Jang Gap-su,

23:24.486 --> 23:25.612
he had…

23:26.113 --> 23:29.408
He had been pushing massive
amounts of drugs for five years.

23:29.491 --> 23:30.700
Detective Jang.

23:30.784 --> 23:32.202
-Yes? Oh, hello.
-Hello.

23:32.285 --> 23:35.872
I know that you had wanted me
to help you and bring this to Mr. Baek,

23:35.956 --> 23:38.291
but I couldn't find the time
to meet him, and--

23:38.375 --> 23:39.251
Ah.

23:39.334 --> 23:42.963
He took advantage of that poor,

23:43.046 --> 23:47.551
naive lady and was using her
as a drug mule for the Korean-Chinese.

24:03.024 --> 24:04.943
Who are you to tell me to come and go?

24:06.403 --> 24:07.446
Detective Jang.

24:08.238 --> 24:09.114
Yeah? What?

24:10.949 --> 24:14.161
Ms. Hwang is okay, right?
She'll be released soon, right?

24:15.036 --> 24:16.538
What? What about her?

24:19.583 --> 24:22.169
Th… there's no way you'd do
something like that, would you?

24:22.669 --> 24:25.005
Uh, all she did
was work at the cafeteria--

24:25.088 --> 24:27.215
What are you even talking about right now?

24:27.924 --> 24:29.384
Th… this must be a cover, right?

24:29.468 --> 24:31.470
Some big plan to take down a drug ring?

24:31.553 --> 24:35.474
She's in on it, and I'm the only one
who wasn't told what's going on, aren't I?

24:35.557 --> 24:36.600
You bastard.

24:37.100 --> 24:39.352
Hey. Have you been drinking?

24:39.936 --> 24:40.812
Huh?

24:42.272 --> 24:43.982
Why would I have been drinking?

24:45.859 --> 24:48.570
For fuck's sake. Come on.

24:48.653 --> 24:50.071
No, no, hang on. Wait.

24:50.155 --> 24:52.574
-You gave me the box to give to Ms. Hwang.
-What box?

24:52.657 --> 24:54.075
-Move, asshole!
-You told me to.

24:54.159 --> 24:56.703
-It was the box on the news!
-What? I never did that.

24:56.786 --> 24:57.954
Sir, why are you lying to me?

24:58.038 --> 25:00.123
-What's going on?
-You bastard! Seriously!

25:07.672 --> 25:08.715
Listen.

25:08.798 --> 25:09.674
Hey.

25:10.425 --> 25:12.302
Everyone's got their reasons.

25:13.512 --> 25:16.681
Did your father kill people
because he wanted to?

25:16.765 --> 25:20.769
Do you want people to point fingers at you
for being the child of a murderer?

25:21.978 --> 25:25.524
I saved you
when you were just a starving kid.

25:26.441 --> 25:28.568
And you do this? Huh?

25:29.903 --> 25:31.196
I knew the whole time.

25:32.572 --> 25:34.741
I knew I kept failing my promotion

25:35.951 --> 25:38.161
because you made sure I didn't get it.

25:40.163 --> 25:41.998
But I wanted to think that you…

25:42.958 --> 25:44.376
you maybe had a reason.

25:44.459 --> 25:46.127
-I guess I was wrong.
-Oh.

25:47.295 --> 25:48.338
This again?

25:48.922 --> 25:50.173
You little…

25:52.133 --> 25:54.511
Song Chon, just think about it.

25:55.220 --> 25:57.764
How could the son of a killer, huh,

25:58.348 --> 26:01.184
ever be a Violent Crimes detective, huh?

26:01.268 --> 26:02.936
It's okay for a dirty cop to be one?

26:04.437 --> 26:07.524
You little shithead.
I'm gonna kill you, I swear.

26:07.607 --> 26:09.109
Fuck's sake!

26:10.026 --> 26:12.404
Get down. Stop it. Down, you little shit!

26:12.487 --> 26:15.615
Please, sir, just tell me why. Why?

26:16.449 --> 26:17.534
Aah.

26:18.285 --> 26:19.536
Look at you.

26:19.619 --> 26:22.330
How did you hide this all along?

26:23.665 --> 26:25.709
Just look at those bloodthirsty eyes.

26:27.294 --> 26:28.461
Son of a killer.

26:29.296 --> 26:30.922
To Jang Gap-su,

26:32.215 --> 26:35.051
I was nothing but the son of a killer.

26:35.135 --> 26:37.012
Stop. Let go.

26:37.929 --> 26:40.015
-Damn it, let go.
-Stop it, sir.

26:40.098 --> 26:41.266
Let go!

26:41.349 --> 26:44.060
-Don't do this.
-I told you, let go. Let go!

26:47.188 --> 26:48.565
Please stop.

26:48.648 --> 26:50.609
I see the apple doesn't fall far.

26:50.692 --> 26:53.111
You want to be a killer like your dad?

26:59.409 --> 27:01.453
When I gave him the first blow,

27:02.078 --> 27:04.039
his face said, "What was that?"

27:10.545 --> 27:11.713
The second blow,

27:13.048 --> 27:14.049
he looked at me

27:15.216 --> 27:16.885
like I was the bad guy.

27:18.511 --> 27:20.013
The third blow,

27:21.473 --> 27:23.224
that's when he started screaming.

27:24.768 --> 27:26.269
After the fourth blow,

27:28.355 --> 27:31.900
he seemed to finally realize
that he was in trouble.

27:33.068 --> 27:34.736
That disgusted me.

27:35.737 --> 27:36.571
So I gave him

27:36.655 --> 27:38.156
the fifth blow.

27:38.740 --> 27:40.033
And then the sixth.

27:40.116 --> 27:42.744
And finally, the seventh.

27:47.123 --> 27:48.750
OFFICER ATTACKED AND PARALYZED

27:48.833 --> 27:50.418
METHAMPHETAMINE SMUGGLER
TAKES OWN LIFE

27:50.502 --> 27:51.920
And now, here we are.

27:53.338 --> 27:54.673
Don't you get it yet?

27:56.257 --> 27:58.551
So why would you take revenge?

27:58.635 --> 28:02.555
If anyone, I'm the one who should have it.

28:07.227 --> 28:09.104
Oh, Nan-gam, I pity you, kid.

28:09.729 --> 28:11.356
Ah. Ugh…

28:12.107 --> 28:13.817
Your father was…

28:15.902 --> 28:17.529
a corrupt cop.

28:18.446 --> 28:19.322
Your mother…

28:21.574 --> 28:23.743
was obscene, a depraved cheater.

28:40.218 --> 28:41.386
Let me finish him.

28:47.016 --> 28:48.518
So you think you're God?

28:50.228 --> 28:51.104
You've…

28:53.231 --> 28:54.899
never killed someone.

28:57.610 --> 29:01.698
-Ah. One last thing…
-Aren't you just as bad as he is?

29:01.781 --> 29:05.285
-If you aren't certain either, then…
-But you should be different.

29:08.747 --> 29:10.165
…you should die too.

30:04.302 --> 30:05.303
It's not…

30:08.723 --> 30:09.974
easy to kill.

30:11.017 --> 30:13.186
Until you get used to it.

30:16.481 --> 30:17.774
It's all over now.

30:24.697 --> 30:26.115
I won't run away again.

30:30.286 --> 30:32.705
CRIME AND PUNISHMENT

31:34.893 --> 31:38.354
Captain Jang Gap-su, you were
a proud member of the police force.

31:38.438 --> 31:39.981
INSPECTOR JANG GAP-SU'S FUNERAL CEREMONY

31:40.064 --> 31:43.985
Ever since you joined us,
you have worked hard and diligently,

31:44.068 --> 31:46.154
making an example for others to follow.

31:46.654 --> 31:49.032
You were a loyal friend
to your fellow officers

31:49.115 --> 31:50.575
and always put others first.

31:51.993 --> 31:53.703
You were a true police officer

31:53.786 --> 31:55.997
who carried out his duty without fail,

31:56.080 --> 31:58.708
and who put people's lives
and safety first,

31:58.791 --> 32:00.460
even when your own was in danger.

32:01.586 --> 32:07.175
Today, we mourn the loss
of a great and competent officer.

32:09.260 --> 32:11.930
However, we will not forget you.

32:13.097 --> 32:15.266
You will always be in our hearts.

32:16.809 --> 32:18.728
We will continue to honor your spirit,

32:20.063 --> 32:22.565
in our work as police officers ourselves.

32:25.318 --> 32:28.905
I was unconscious for three days
after the brain surgery.

32:29.656 --> 32:31.783
I'm still unable to move my head.

32:33.493 --> 32:37.246
This is a subarachnoid hemorrhage, okay?

32:38.081 --> 32:41.626
I have recovered a lot in just ten days
in here. Not everyone does.

32:43.002 --> 32:47.465
I'm just saying that some people can take
several years to ever fully recover.

32:49.258 --> 32:54.305
According to my doctor,
I have my fitness regimen to, uh… thank…

33:03.356 --> 33:04.774
So why are you here?

33:07.735 --> 33:09.779
-Me?
-Yeah.

33:11.030 --> 33:13.116
You're here for a reason, aren't you?

33:15.243 --> 33:17.203
Hey, I'm just here to visit, all right?

33:22.417 --> 33:23.376
That's nice.

33:25.712 --> 33:26.629
By the way,

33:27.630 --> 33:29.340
the nurse is super cute, right?

33:31.592 --> 33:32.510
Just saying,

33:33.636 --> 33:35.388
she's been especially kind to me.

33:39.726 --> 33:43.563
That's why I'm gonna
ask her out when I get out.

33:44.188 --> 33:46.232
What are you gonna say
when you ask her out?

33:47.191 --> 33:48.943
"I'm actually a detective."

33:49.902 --> 33:51.738
"A Violent Crimes detective."

33:51.821 --> 33:53.990
"I was injured
while going after a criminal,

33:54.699 --> 33:57.535
and I'll catch the guy
when I get discharged."

33:58.161 --> 33:59.245
So, yeah.

33:59.328 --> 34:03.958
-Be sure to give us the full report, okay?
-Sure. So, How do you think it'll go?

34:06.544 --> 34:07.962
I think she'll say yes.

34:18.431 --> 34:21.434
You didn't file an appeal
for your suspension in the end.

34:22.435 --> 34:24.937
I did something wrong.
I should be punished for it.

34:26.773 --> 34:28.357
I don't understand.

34:28.441 --> 34:30.651
-You could've said it was self-defense--
-Just…

34:32.361 --> 34:33.905
Please just cut to the chase.

34:35.782 --> 34:36.824
Okay, then.

34:39.744 --> 34:41.996
Hmm. I'll try to make it brief for you.

34:43.664 --> 34:45.917
Did he seem like
the sort of person who'd do that?

34:48.252 --> 34:52.006
I thought it was the profiler's job
to figure out that sort of thing?

34:54.592 --> 34:56.469
I'm only following standard protocol.

34:57.303 --> 35:00.640
We have the evidence.
Your statement has to line up.

35:02.391 --> 35:05.520
If you have evidence in front of you,
maybe you should trust that.

35:08.272 --> 35:09.649
So what's the conclusion, then?

35:14.403 --> 35:16.823
This is our conclusion.

35:16.906 --> 35:20.368
Song Chon has been
on the run after killing 30 people

35:20.451 --> 35:22.662
and two police officers
over the past five years.

35:22.745 --> 35:25.123
POLICE BRIEFING ON THE APPREHENSION
OF SERIAL KILLER SONG CHON

35:25.206 --> 35:29.127
After a long pursuit,
we found him and eliminated him.

35:29.919 --> 35:32.672
His accomplice and co-conspirator,
Roh Bin,

35:33.172 --> 35:34.507
who helped Song Chon

35:35.341 --> 35:37.051
and murdered five victims,

35:37.135 --> 35:40.304
including Prosecutor Ji,
Professor No and Gyeong-bae,

35:42.598 --> 35:44.392
was also eliminated at the scene.

35:44.892 --> 35:48.437
Ron Bin's incriminating evidence,
the alibi, and circumstances.

35:48.521 --> 35:50.022
They all fit perfectly.

35:50.773 --> 35:54.277
We found evidence that he researched
his victims for a long time.

35:54.360 --> 35:57.029
All of the murders were planned
by Roh Bin.

35:58.823 --> 36:01.450
To be able to close a case like this,
you must have a culprit.

36:02.535 --> 36:05.413
We found a large number
of what we suspect to be murder weapons

36:05.496 --> 36:06.831
in Roh Bin's storage room.

36:08.040 --> 36:11.627
And… I'm the one
who knows about all the cases.

36:11.711 --> 36:12.587
So,

36:13.754 --> 36:15.548
let me be the one to finish it.

36:17.675 --> 36:20.052
He's much more meticulous
than he seems.

36:22.305 --> 36:23.848
How did he leave no prints?

36:23.931 --> 36:25.892
Spotless crime scenes. It's striking.

36:27.185 --> 36:30.396
But… we did find one decisive clue.

36:30.980 --> 36:33.482
No matter how careful you are,
you're bound to make a mistake.

36:35.193 --> 36:36.694
Fortunately, or…

36:37.612 --> 36:39.238
Really, it's a bit unfortunate.

36:39.822 --> 36:41.741
There was a heavy rain on that day,

36:42.366 --> 36:44.410
so we couldn't find any DNA evidence.

36:45.411 --> 36:47.997
But ironically, he left his teeth marks.

36:48.998 --> 36:50.750
On the day Song Chon died,

36:54.003 --> 36:57.465
I couldn't find much, with the suspect's
body completely burnt up.

36:59.175 --> 37:01.552
But there was something
that could be recovered.

37:04.388 --> 37:05.306
Roh Bin's molars.

37:05.389 --> 37:08.309
Uh…
I don't know if this'll work.

37:09.060 --> 37:11.354
Uh, I've never done this.

37:12.063 --> 37:13.606
Only you can make this happen.

37:16.108 --> 37:20.196
Roh Bin's teeth alignment is
very similar to Professor No's murderer.

37:23.532 --> 37:26.535
Let's say everything goes as you plan.
What do you get in return?

37:29.330 --> 37:30.414
Justice.

37:35.294 --> 37:37.213
I'm probably gonna die.

37:38.339 --> 37:39.465
I'm a little afraid.

37:40.633 --> 37:44.595
But I guess
that having a reliable sidekick like me

37:45.680 --> 37:47.431
is part of Tang's powers.

37:49.809 --> 37:51.727
Why do you think Roh Bin did this?

37:55.273 --> 37:57.608
What made him so confident in what he did?

38:01.654 --> 38:02.571
Hmm.

38:03.698 --> 38:05.908
From a profiler's perspective,

38:07.118 --> 38:10.413
he's the type who can't differentiate
between reality and fantasy.

38:11.622 --> 38:14.125
A megalomaniac who wanted to be a god.

38:14.875 --> 38:18.462
It's plausible that he was
stunted in his emotional development

38:18.546 --> 38:20.006
as a child and young man.

38:20.089 --> 38:22.508
This was most likely due to abuse.

38:22.591 --> 38:23.968
Emotional abuse, that is,

38:24.051 --> 38:27.263
at the hands of those around him
after his parents' tragic death.

38:27.805 --> 38:29.140
Great, thank you.

38:29.640 --> 38:30.933
We need to make some adjustments.

38:31.017 --> 38:33.144
-We'll start again in a minute.
-Thank you, miss.

38:33.978 --> 38:36.856
Hey, listen, sir, regarding the questions
in the interview we did earlier…

38:36.939 --> 38:39.233
I actually have
a question for you.

38:40.109 --> 38:40.985
What is it?

38:41.777 --> 38:43.154
It's about your statement.

38:44.488 --> 38:48.326
Do you think that Roh Bin was
remotely capable of doing this on his own?

38:55.583 --> 38:58.252
And the one
that you were attempting to get, Lee Tang.

39:00.379 --> 39:03.341
He was indeed at the club
and also in Busan.

39:05.009 --> 39:08.596
It's just, we never could find
anything to incriminate him, so…

39:11.682 --> 39:14.310
Well, do you think
this is also a coincidence?

39:20.483 --> 39:22.443
When Song Chon and Roh Bin died,

39:25.071 --> 39:26.530
was Lee Tang there?

39:30.618 --> 39:31.452
You.

39:33.371 --> 39:35.122
Why did you have to come back here?

39:45.466 --> 39:47.009
I thought it would never end.

39:51.430 --> 39:52.306
If I, um…

39:54.725 --> 39:56.435
didn't finish what I started…

40:01.273 --> 40:03.067
and do it with my own hands,

40:07.863 --> 40:09.448
I thought that this would never end.

40:30.428 --> 40:32.054
This is the choice I'm making.

40:43.357 --> 40:45.985
No one will acknowledge you
for doing this, you know?

40:52.700 --> 40:54.243
You're right.

40:57.204 --> 40:59.123
Justice that no one acknowledges…

41:01.333 --> 41:02.501
isn't justice.

41:12.928 --> 41:14.346
I'm done running away.

41:49.423 --> 41:50.966
Was this your luck again?

41:52.134 --> 41:53.636
Lee Tang.

41:56.347 --> 41:58.432
Do you really think that you're different

41:59.600 --> 42:01.060
because of your dumb luck?

42:17.284 --> 42:18.536
Do whatever you want.

42:21.455 --> 42:23.290
Just like that bastard planned,

42:24.416 --> 42:26.961
you can run away or turn yourself in.

42:27.044 --> 42:28.587
It's really up to you now.

42:36.971 --> 42:37.846
But…

42:40.516 --> 42:42.142
you'll get caught at some point.

42:43.352 --> 42:44.770
Even if it's not by me.

44:28.874 --> 44:31.919
CRIME AND PUNISHMENT

44:58.320 --> 45:00.739
-You're in charge of this place?
-Yes.

45:00.823 --> 45:03.450
Okay.
Well, how do you think the fire started?

45:04.618 --> 45:08.497
Oh, well, we haven't used
this factory in years, so…

45:08.580 --> 45:09.415
Right.

45:09.498 --> 45:11.458
If it had been raining and humid,

45:11.542 --> 45:13.752
and maybe someone had turned the power on,

45:13.836 --> 45:17.339
then there could've been an arc
that could've led to a short.

45:19.341 --> 45:22.803
Sir, when was the last time
you did an inspection on this place?

45:22.886 --> 45:24.471
Right, so…

45:50.080 --> 45:52.082
Okay.

45:54.251 --> 45:55.919
Goodness, it's cold.

45:56.962 --> 45:59.923
Ah, he should've come to church
instead of shoveling.

46:03.385 --> 46:04.470
Hey, you're home.

46:05.095 --> 46:07.014
Listen, if you were going
to shovel the snow,

46:07.097 --> 46:09.224
you could've come to church instead.

46:10.100 --> 46:12.728
-Oh, did it snow?
-You…

46:12.811 --> 46:13.729
Uh…

46:54.520 --> 46:57.147
All actions have consequences.

46:59.066 --> 47:00.484
Justice above the law?

47:02.027 --> 47:03.821
No matter how just the action is,

47:04.530 --> 47:07.699
you must face the consequences
within the boundaries of the law,

47:08.450 --> 47:09.910
one way or another.

47:10.661 --> 47:12.412
Nan-gam is an idiot.

47:12.496 --> 47:14.998
He quit being a detective
to avenge his father.

47:18.001 --> 47:20.337
He'd be better off
if he stayed put like I did.

47:21.255 --> 47:23.340
That again, huh? I don't wanna hear it.

47:24.174 --> 47:25.759
Talk about something else.

47:25.843 --> 47:29.137
-I don't have anything else to talk about.
-Dong-u, you need to eat.

47:29.221 --> 47:31.932
-Sit properly. Closer, okay?
-Absolutely nothin'.

47:32.015 --> 47:32.891
Scooch in.

47:33.392 --> 47:35.143
This is why you always spill food.

47:36.103 --> 47:37.813
Eat up. Aah!

47:39.773 --> 47:42.150
-Here, try some of this.
-This place is boring.

47:42.234 --> 47:43.861
It's so peaceful around here.

47:45.279 --> 47:47.656
-Is it expensive to ride them?
-Probably.

47:47.739 --> 47:50.701
-You're right. Must be.
-Dong-u. Stop running! Come here.

47:50.784 --> 47:51.618
Here.

47:52.744 --> 47:55.247
Why are you running off alone?
You startled me.

47:56.039 --> 47:56.999
Hmm?

47:59.543 --> 48:00.794
Honey, what's wrong?

48:10.387 --> 48:11.513
What is it?

48:13.682 --> 48:14.558
Nothing.

48:17.311 --> 48:18.770
What's with you, huh?

48:21.273 --> 48:22.733
I'm doing really well.

48:25.027 --> 48:27.529
But I don't think
I can come back right now.

48:32.910 --> 48:34.620
I don't think I can handle…

48:37.122 --> 48:38.790
the things that I've done

48:39.458 --> 48:41.043
or the things that'll happen.

48:45.756 --> 48:47.257
That's it. That's it.

48:47.799 --> 48:49.051
Okay, that's fine.

49:17.371 --> 49:19.957
Hi, sir. Excuse me.
Where are you from?

49:26.088 --> 49:27.589
Can I see your passport?

49:41.520 --> 49:42.604
Hey, Chinese.

49:43.105 --> 49:45.023
Hey! Come here!

49:45.107 --> 49:46.191
Come here!

49:54.616 --> 49:57.703
An illegal stay, a fake passport.

49:59.329 --> 50:00.580
You here to gamble?

50:01.248 --> 50:02.082
That's not it.

50:02.916 --> 50:06.086
Then why are you here?
It doesn't look like you're here to work.

50:09.631 --> 50:12.050
People don't often come here illegally,
you know.

50:12.926 --> 50:14.761
You haven't committed any crimes.

50:15.554 --> 50:16.847
Your records are clean.

50:17.472 --> 50:20.100
So why go through the trouble
of stowing away?

50:22.686 --> 50:23.687
Huh?

50:24.312 --> 50:25.772
All right. See ya.

50:28.108 --> 50:28.984
Ah.

50:29.693 --> 50:30.610
Lieutenant Lee.

50:31.486 --> 50:32.654
Yes, sir?

50:32.738 --> 50:36.491
Did you find anything out of the ordinary
or significant in there?

50:37.159 --> 50:38.618
Not sure.

50:39.494 --> 50:41.329
I just don't want to drag this thing out.

50:41.413 --> 50:44.249
The news and YouTubers are
all whipping up these stories

50:44.332 --> 50:45.667
like this is some kind of movie.

50:47.544 --> 50:51.339
It'd be best for us if we wrapped
this one up neatly and quickly, hmm?

50:51.423 --> 50:55.302
-You hear what I'm saying?
-Yeah, well, it won't take too long.

50:56.178 --> 50:57.345
-You sure?
-Yeah.

50:58.138 --> 50:59.514
Of course. Mm.

50:59.598 --> 51:02.434
I couldn't find any trace
of Lee Tang anywhere.

51:05.103 --> 51:07.355
Which is why
your statement is so important.

51:07.856 --> 51:11.318
Depending on what you say,
Lee Tang becomes our lead suspect.

51:13.987 --> 51:15.363
Do you suppose, then,

51:16.782 --> 51:20.160
that he might have something to do,
then, with this case in any way?

51:45.227 --> 51:47.979
PROSECUTOR AN SE-SEUNG

51:48.063 --> 51:51.233
CASE RECORDS AND NON-INDICTMENT DECISION

51:51.316 --> 51:52.984
SUSPECT: LEE TANG
CHARGE: MURDER

51:53.068 --> 51:55.195
DECISION: DISMISSED (LACK OF EVIDENCE)

52:17.425 --> 52:19.636
SOUTH KOREA

53:02.679 --> 53:03.597
How much?

53:05.265 --> 53:06.850
-Two packs of gum.
-Breaking news.

53:06.933 --> 53:09.686
-Give me a second.
-Kim was found dead last month.

53:09.769 --> 53:13.607
-Let's see. For two, it's 3,000 won.
-He was the prime suspect in a murder.

53:13.690 --> 53:15.942
It occurred three years ago
in Danyang, Chungbuk.

53:16.818 --> 53:20.238
When identifying Kim, the police
found irregularities in his records,

53:20.322 --> 53:22.199
and after a subsequent investigation,

53:22.282 --> 53:25.285
Kim's DNA was studied and found
to match the genetic material

53:25.368 --> 53:28.205
of the prime suspect
in the abduction and murder case

53:28.288 --> 53:30.332
in Danyang, Chungbuk, three years ago.

53:30.415 --> 53:32.834
It's beginning to look like
a string of subsequent murders

53:32.918 --> 53:34.127
may also be linked…

53:35.712 --> 53:38.340
-Hey, it's been so long.
-Hey, long time no see, man.

53:39.549 --> 53:40.717
Yeah, how you doin'?

53:42.093 --> 53:43.470
Oh. I'm sorry.
